  {
   "seq": 7,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "A ConfigMap is an API object\nthat lets you store configuration for other objects to use. Unlike most\nKubernetes objects that have a `spec`, a ConfigMap has `data` and `binaryData`\nfields. These fields accept key-value pairs as their values.  Both the `data`\nfield and the `binaryData` are optional. The `data` field is designed to\ncontain UTF-8 strings while the `binaryData` field is designed to\ncontain binary data as base64-encoded strings.",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 2,
   "target": "ConfigMap 是一种 API 对象，允许你存储供其他对象使用的配置。与具有 `spec` 的大多数 Kubernetes 对象不同，ConfigMap 具有 `data` 和 `binaryData` 字段。这些字段接受键值对作为其值。`data` 字段和 `binaryData` 都是可选的。`data` 字段用于包含 UTF-8 字符串，而 `binaryData` 字段用于包含以 base64 编码字符串表示的二进制 data。",
   "status": "DONE",
   "reviewScore": null,
   "reviewRounds": 0,
   "compliance": [
    {
     "source": "ConfigMap",
     "target": "ConfigMap",
     "compliant": true
    },
    {
     "source": "data",
     "target": "data",
     "compliant": true
    },
    {
     "source": "Kubernetes",
     "target": "Kubernetes",
     "compliant": true
    }
   ],
   "edited": false,
   "tmHits": []
  },
  {
   "seq": 8,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "The name of a ConfigMap must be a valid\n[DNS subdomain name](/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#dns-subdomain-names).",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 2,
   "target": "ConfigMap 的名称必须是有效的 [DNS 子域名](/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#dns-subdomain-names)。",
   "status": "DONE",
   "reviewScore": null,
   "reviewRounds": 0,
   "compliance": [
    {
     "source": "ConfigMap",
     "target": "ConfigMap",
     "compliant": true
    }
   ],
   "edited": false,
   "tmHits": []
  },
  {
   "seq": 9,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "Each key under the `data` or the `binaryData` field must consist of\nalphanumeric characters, `-`, `_` or `.`. The keys stored in `data` must not\noverlap with the keys in the `binaryData` field.",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 2,
   "target": "`data` 或 `binaryData` 字段下的每个键都必须由字母数字字符、`-`、`_` 或 `.` 组成。存储在 `data` 中的键不得与 `binaryData` 字段中的键重叠。",
   "status": "DONE",
   "reviewScore": null,
   "reviewRounds": 0,
   "compliance": [],
   "edited": false,
   "tmHits": []
  },
  {
   "seq": 10,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "Starting from v1.19, you can add an `immutable` field to a ConfigMap\ndefinition to create an [immutable ConfigMap](#configmap-immutable).",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 2,
   "target": "从 v1.19 开始，你可以在 ConfigMap 定义中添加 `immutable` 字段，以创建一个[不可变 ConfigMap](#configmap-immutable)。",
   "status": "DONE",
