  {
   "seq": 24,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "A ConfigMap doesn't differentiate between single line property values and\nmulti-line file-like values.\nWhat matters is how Pods and other objects consume those values.",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 3,
   "target": "ConfigMap 不区分单行属性值和\n多行文件类值。\n重要的是 Pod 和其他对象如何使用这些值。",
   "status": "DONE",
   "reviewScore": null,
   "reviewRounds": 0,
   "compliance": [
    {
     "source": "ConfigMap",
     "target": "ConfigMap",
     "compliant": true
    }
   ],
   "edited": false,
   "tmHits": []
  },
  {
   "seq": 25,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "For this example, defining a volume and mounting it inside the `demo`\ncontainer as `/config` creates two files,\n`/config/game.properties` and `/config/user-interface.properties`,\neven though there are four keys in the ConfigMap. This is because the Pod\ndefinition specifies an `items` array in the `volumes` section.\nIf you omit the `items` array entirely, every key  in the ConfigMap becomes\na file with the same name as the key, and you get 4 files.",
   "suffix": "\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 3,
   "target": "对于此示例，定义一个卷，并将其挂载到 `demo`\n容器中作为 `/config`，会创建两个文件，\n`/config/game.properties` 和 `/config/user-interface.properties`，\n即使 ConfigMap 中有四个键。这是因为 Pod\n定义在 `volumes` 部分指定了一个 `items` 数组。\n如果完全省略 `items` 数组，ConfigMap 中的每个键都会成为\n一个与该键同名的文件，此时会得到 4 个文件。",
   "status": "DONE",
